{"schemaVersion":1,"patchVersion":"26.13","previousPatchVersion":"26.12","sources":{"ddragon":"16.13.1","cdragon":"16.13"},"previousSources":{"ddragon":"16.12.1","cdragon":"16.12"},"comparedChampions":172,"comparedItems":316,"entries":[{"id":"Locke","kind":"champion","name":{"ko_KR":"로크","en_US":"Locke","zh_CN":"灰烬驱魔人"},"changes":[{"id":"official/0/0/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/0/0","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"P","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"은빛 말뚝","en_US":"Silver Stake","zh_CN":"圣银穿心"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"기본 공격 적중 시 추가 마법 피해를 입힙니다. 피해량은 적이 잃은 체력에 비례해 증가합니다.","en_US":"Locke's attacks deal additional magic damage On-Hit, increased based on enemy missing Health.","zh_CN":"洛克的普攻命中時造成額外魔法傷害，且傷害隨敵軍已損失生命提升。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/1/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/1/0","gameDataKey":"Locke/abilities/Q/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"Q","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"의식용 대못","en_US":"Ritual Nails","zh_CN":"伏魔三钉"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"로크가 영혼의 대못을 여러 개 준비하고 던져 적중한 적에게 피해를 입히고 표식을 남깁니다. 로크는 기본 공격으로 표식을 소모하고 추가 피해를 입힐 수 있습니다.","en_US":"Locke readies a set of Soul Nails to throw, dealing damage to and marking enemies hit. Locke can consume the marks to deal bonus damage with his attacks.","zh_CN":"洛克取出一組靈魂釘並擲出，造成傷害並標記命中的敵軍。洛克的普攻可以消耗咒釘標記，造成額外傷害。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/2/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/2/0","gameDataKey":"Locke/abilities/W/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"W","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"영혼 점화","en_US":"Soul Ignition","zh_CN":"灵焰仪式"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"로크가 자신의 영혼을 불태워 공격 속도와 이동 속도를 얻고 자신에게 피해를 입힙니다. 지속시간이 끝나면 로크는 효과 지속시간 동안 받은 피해량의 일부를 회복합니다.","en_US":"Locke ignites his soul, gaining Attack Speed and Move Speed, and dealing damage to himself. At the end of the duration, Locke will heal back a portion of the damage he takes during the effect.","zh_CN":"洛克點燃自己的靈魂，獲得攻速和跑速，並對自己造成傷害。效果結束時，洛克會治療部分效果期間所受傷害。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/3/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/3/0","gameDataKey":"Locke/abilities/E/cooldown","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"E","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"잿빛 추격","en_US":"Ashen Pursuit","zh_CN":"灰猎无影"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"로크가 지정한 위치로 순간이동한 후 다음 대상에게 돌진해 공격하며, 경로상의 적에게 피해를 입힙니다.","en_US":"Locke teleports to a location before dashing to attack his next target, dealing damage to enemies passed through.","zh_CN":"洛克傳送到一個位置，接著衝刺攻擊下一個目標，對途中經過的敵軍造成傷害。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/4/0","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/4/0","gameDataKey":"Characters/Locke/Spells/LockeRAbility/LockeR/values/BaseDamage","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"改动"},"section":"R","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"연옥","en_US":"Purgatory","zh_CN":"万魔狱"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"로크가 적을 구속하는 유물을 던져 적중한 적에게 피해를 입히고 경우에 따라 처형합니다. 로크는 적 챔피언을 봉인해 추가 위력을 얻습니다.","en_US":"Locke throws a binding artifact that deals damage and potentially executes enemies hit. Locke gains additional power for sealing away enemy champions.","zh_CN":"洛克投擲一件縛魂神器，對命中的敵軍造成傷害，並有機會封印處決目標。洛克封印敵方英雄時會獲得額外力量。"},"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"official/0/4/1","valueType":"text","sourceKey":"official/0/4/1","gameDataKey":"Characters/Locke/Spells/LockeRAbility/LockeR/values/BaseDamage","label":{"ko_KR":"변경 사항","en_US":"Change","zh_CN":"點此查看 《英雄聚光燈》"},"section":"R","sectionName":{"ko_KR":"연옥","en_US":"Purgatory","zh_CN":"万魔狱"},"before":{"ko_KR":"","en_US":"","zh_CN":""},"after":{"ko_KR":"로크 챔피언 집중탐구는 여기 에서 확인하실 수 있습니다!","en_US":"Locke Champion Spotlight here !","zh_CN":"洛克！"},"impact":"adjustment"}],"impact":"adjustment"},{"id":"Aphelios","kind":"champion","name":{"ko_KR":"아펠리오스","en_US":"Aphelios","zh_CN":"残月